  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regular support for vulnerable groups in Kharkiv</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at providing humanitarian assistance to the elderly, people with disabilities, people with limited mobility, and people evacuated from liberated territories who currently have no one to take care of them. We provide them with food kits, hygiene products twice a month as well as equipment (crutches, beds, flashlights, wheelchairs, etc.) needed to ensure decent living conditions.   Currently, we take care of 595 people in the city of Kharkiv.</narrative>
  </description>
